[{"title":"端午诸同志集草堂得丝字","author":"沈鍊","text":"帝里风光丽，相逢属令时。\n地除三径僻，人比八龙奇。\n蒲叶分倾酒，榴花对赋诗。\n秖应刻华烛，何用续朱丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23015,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈户曹赴南部","author":"沈鍊","text":"年少异冯唐，风流汉省郎。\n金陵千里道，粉署几枝香。\n意气壶浆集，声名歌吹长。\n黄金知不顾，赠子以干将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23016,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送岑山人出塞","author":"沈鍊","text":"黄云马首横，仗剑赴边城。\n虽歌出塞曲，讵谓从军行。\n炎夏征途壮，河山旅望惊。\n从来班定远，曾是一书生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23017,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴集南镇山池","author":"沈鍊","text":"桂席俯云端，山禽舞合欢。\n羽觞流满月，仙馆发幽兰。\n香醑花能酿，清丝水共弹。\n不知歌咏地，犹作晋衣冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23018,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张子良归省","author":"沈鍊","text":"才子趋朝日，宁亲亦暂还。\n应将宫锦色，去作舞衣斑。\n马上生归梦，樽中展别颜。\n平生怀献纳，未可滞乡关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23019,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗三首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"乾坤真鼎气，日月自炉锤。\n一得调元手，千秋正气绥。\n褊心亏旷达，小智骋雕追。\n谁识真仙道，天然理自随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23020,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗三首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"刚风千劫际，妙法九华筵。\n道外应无地，心中自有天。\n玉笙吹引鹤，朱果弄调猿。\n驾驭英䧺毕，骖鸾礼上玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23021,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗三首 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"上仙传宝诀，经世即长生。\n寿域开黄道，慈云丽赤城。\n琴中调造化，奕里运神兵。\n功行三千满，应知颂太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐观张博士平边疏章赋此寄之","author":"沈鍊","text":"迁客不能寐，吹箫度夜分。\n因思前席事，一读贾生文。\n豪士家临水，雄关阵入云。\n高歌还达曙，何日共垂勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘副将","author":"沈鍊","text":"边塞一相逢，怜君旧总戎。\n名成五军佐，心是万夫䧺。\n虎节悲歌里，龙韬欢笑中。\n别来犹感慨，耿耿望长虹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得梦中携宝剑","author":"沈鍊","text":"烈士壮心惊，将过铁勒城。\n恩从愁里结，勇向梦中生。\n神物千年隐，奇文七字成。\n匈奴犹未灭，持此欲横行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示襄衮二儿","author":"沈鍊","text":"吾生当国难，两疏谪边关。\n思亲太行道，忆主敬亭山。\n风急吹玄鬓，时危损玉颜。\n尔曹俱努力，戈戟正珊珊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴仕贤","author":"沈鍊","text":"本为珠履客，聊寄玉壶仙。\n经济悬龙剑，雄豪跃马鞭。\n题诗五綵笔，写恨七条弦。\n边塞多风谊，因逢吴仕贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲春会诸生赋","author":"沈鍊","text":"羽檄边声急，将军出塞迟。\n时危思讲武，日永笑弹棋。\n白发龙堆梦，丹心韬略知。\n诸生各努力，仗剑解重围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前山曲为李直夫赋","author":"沈鍊","text":"本怀金马调，言对翠微居。\n水竹流词翰，云霞杂草书。\n幽探踪迹秘，高卧姓名疏。\n得意在丘壑，他年升九衢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古别离","author":"沈鍊","text":"非关岐路多，君意自蹉跎。\n拭泪攀杨柳，将心托绮罗。\n北风吹祖帐，秋月照离歌。\n斗酒今宵尽，明朝奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀台","author":"沈鍊","text":"西陵郁何近，台畔绮罗施。\n蕙帐流明月，光辉异昔时。\n舞衣还拭泪，歌曲总成悲。\n妾愿从君化，长为陵树枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘生","author":"沈鍊","text":"刘生怀宝剑，结束愿从戎。\n指顾边尘上，遨游燕市中。\n淹留心似石，谈笑气成虹。\n斗酒悲知己，谁令欢宴同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日率诸生同游紫阳洞","author":"沈鍊","text":"朱夏洞天明，仙宫敞玉京。\n烟霞通一道，歌管并诸生。\n香气因风度，瑶华是石成。\n从来耽羽化，今日共霞征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意一首和童侍御","author":"沈鍊","text":"西阁开罗荐，东邻出艳妆。\n听歌娇欲转，看舞意先翔。\n映日流珠钿，因风落佩香。\n不知台畔客，俱是冶游郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"沈鍊","text":"白日云相薄，青楼树作屏。\n石枝零夜雨，莺语恰春晴。\n湖水明新练，山花散锦城。\n可能开杖屦，孤眺坐轻盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁节推考绩","author":"沈鍊","text":"平生识明府，为吏却黄金。\n罗袖回沧渚，香飙出蕙林。\n赠行嗟宝剑，念别怅瑶琴。\n难以一杯酒，酌君千载心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周大尹入觐","author":"沈鍊","text":"却金为汉吏，马首气何䧺。\n将上河阳计，先乘御史骢。\n旌旗飏古节，鼓吹奏民风。\n今日山阴道，方知在镜中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送山阴兰博邑教授湖州","author":"沈鍊","text":"奉檄是儒官，驱车出上兰。\n壶觞追饯处，桃李满城看。\n念别嗟双剑，随身只一冠。\n苏湖得君往，古道重波澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送冯达甫北上","author":"沈鍊","text":"江树正含情，维舟送远征。\n河梁南雁起，岐路北云生。\n剑气冲牛斗，箫声达凤城。\n不知离别处，斗酒为谁倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李宝山将军","author":"沈鍊","text":"将军休剑甲，日燕宝山居。\n月散千林绮，泉流万壑珠。\n香云迷武骑，花露滴军书。\n乘秋还校猎，非是乐樵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为童昌原母寿赋","author":"沈鍊","text":"白发垂堂日，朱筵献寿时。\n能招万里客，来上百年卮。\n黄竹歌偏远，斑斓舞未迟。\n余为彤管赋，千载列风诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别南衡童侍御二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"迁客怀文藻，应知是谪仙。\n徒云离殿阙，犹得览山川。\n白简经霜折，丹心共日悬。\n若过楚水上，莫赋吊湘篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别南衡童侍御二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"送别随征盖，那能向水滨。\n共知今日酒，不是故园春。\n河柳骄行色，岩花笑谪臣。\n千金装宝剑，可以赠斯人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠望洋刘子","author":"沈鍊","text":"日下刘公干，文成五色霞。\n纵游春苑马，沉醉夜阑花。\n宝剑光频发，瑶琴意独赊。\n时闻边骑动，往往泣悲笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"沈鍊","text":"飞梁跨浦口，遥睇海山沉。\n潮落空城暮，云低断壑阴。\n三山区外想，亿劫幻中心。\n试问蓬莱水，于今复几深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张司丞","author":"沈鍊","text":"十载为郎吏，三时候选曹。\n数奇才愈拙，官冷气偏豪。\n叹老持明镜，忧边看宝刀。\n若逢知己誉，置我在临洮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张玉亭刑曹","author":"沈鍊","text":"闻道张平子，閒居赋四愁。\n行吟过郎署，坐啸在皇州。\n水石分亭榭，烟霞入佩钩。\n还寻高咏士，骑马共行游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得茅鹿门别驾广平消息","author":"沈鍊","text":"故人嗟远道，书是雁传来。\n不因迁客苦，谁为寄江梅。\n驿路长驱马，官亭独举杯。\n悬知汉廷吏，当识贾生才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡二川为长山令","author":"沈鍊","text":"莫厌郎官薄，专城气本奢。\n符分玄圃竹，绶结上林花。\n啜水行时政，鸣琴坐晓衙。\n他年循吏传，谁数五侯家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送宋承山作祁门令","author":"沈鍊","text":"知君五凤客，亦复跨双凫。\n宋玉名高楚，郎官宿应吴。\n仁心琴里发，民事镜中苏。\n送别无须酒，阳春在路衢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23050,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞河作和张司丞二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"近阙山河丽，乘春景物明。\n中流波作锦，夹岸柳如城。\n云动飞帆影，风回杂鼓声。\n况逢张博望，何异泛槎行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23051,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞河作和张司丞二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"玉珂知不并，兰棹幸同游。\n听莺堤畔树，送雁驿边楼。\n歌外风轻度，杯中月暗浮。\n徒知行役久，无复越乡忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23052,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫中江仪曹见过","author":"沈鍊","text":"懒性妨冠盖，君来更作欢。\n声名堪比凤，意气重过兰。\n山水朱弦里，风云綵笔端。\n还因竹林赏，一遣酒杯宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23053,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱梅泉赴东乡博","author":"沈鍊","text":"文学重朱云，传经楚国闻。\n仕官为博士，垂老恋明君。\n礼乐乘时曙，斋宫达夜分。\n丈夫怀气节，随地策功勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23054,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣衣","author":"沈鍊","text":"阶庭木叶下，是妾捣衣时。\n秋风度纨素，萧瑟不胜悲。\n泪垂双杵落，魂向百城驰。\n妾意千重转，君心恐未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23055,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼友父","author":"沈鍊","text":"白首朱门客，言从地下游。\n平生醉罗绮，今夕卧松楸。\n月照泉台夜，风生陇岸秋。\n一嗟流水恨，千载共悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23056,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈蓝田","author":"沈鍊","text":"蓝茝讵为芬，言栖陇亩云。\n色凌秋坞竹，香带晓堂芸。\n雾捲千山出，川回匹练分。\n琴书足投赏，谁羡赤城文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23057,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丁君赴宜阳县令","author":"沈鍊","text":"名士宰方城，驱车出汉京。\n赠言多丽藻，饯别有诸卿。\n行李先随鹤，前驱早抗旌。\n看君作循吏，不负宝刀横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23058,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王龙阜给使广西宗藩二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"离别自多感，况逢知己行。\n黄金耻为赠，白羽去何轻。\n惜别芳樽满，临岐宝剑横。\n为君弹出塞，慷慨献平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23059,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王龙阜给使广西宗藩二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"侍臣将使节，王命一何尊。\n万里踰荒徼，浑如在掖垣。\n藩台应并服，渔牧总攀轩。\n珥笔驱皇路，归来献纳繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23060,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨往三江送郑梧野还歙","author":"沈鍊","text":"高士怀名赏，偏乘风雨来。\n秋声清鼓吹，霁色映楼台。\n杨柳吹将折，芙蓉润欲开。\n送君如浦水，临发更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23061,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送章东称江右宪伯","author":"沈鍊","text":"宪卿持节钺，千里障元元。\n不因飞白简，何以驾朱轩。\n夜月清征旆，秋风壮别樽。\n知君历荆楚，所至有平反。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23062,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东溪曲赠赵大将军","author":"沈鍊","text":"仗剑事边塞，那言山水间。\n自因心洞达，所以乐潺湲。\n日出荡舟远，风轻垂钓閒。\n谁知烟雾里，能距玉门关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23063,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送葛春谷","author":"沈鍊","text":"我已苦为县，不堪行送君。\n谁令一片月，散作两行云。\n杨柳堤边折，葡萄马上分。\n相思莫相问，但遣令名闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23064,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒲厓篇赠叶上舍","author":"沈鍊","text":"本是青云客，言依绿水边。\n玉堂何用早，蒲渚且悠然。\n雨叶流书草，烟花泊钓船。\n栖迟意不浅，勋业待施鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23065,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮夜怀袁定山仪曹","author":"沈鍊","text":"不觉落花尽，长怀饮饯时。\n流光徒屈指，辛苦有谁知。\n夜月凄琴曲，春风隔酒卮。\n闻君消息到，翻重别离悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23066,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉酬王东华使君","author":"沈鍊","text":"春夜抱琴弄，知君调独高。\n但从心曲转，不厌指中劳。\n慷慨扬朱旆，低回看宝刀。\n若非驰道路，何以念同袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23067,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王东华明府考绩五首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"持节过魏郡，三年气色多。\n清光如满月，耿耿照漳河。\n马瘦征人剧，门閒隐者过。\n将归报明主，行矣莫蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23068,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王东华明府考绩五首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"行李河桥发，清宵一剑悬。\n铃声传大道，盖影入长川。\n名重曾誇凤，官清不异仙。\n谁能持节钺，匹马去朝天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23069,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王东华明府考绩五首 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"符篆青春发，公庭白日开。\n自能轻巧宦，何恨乏良媒。\n行李书三箧，壶餐水一杯。\n徒闻薄杨震，无复夜金来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23070,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王东华明府考绩五首 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"千里流恩泽，应同漳水回。\n那逢持钺使，偏是牧人才。\n令发阳春布，冤清澍雨来。\n悬知捧明月，从此照燕台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23071,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王东华明府考绩五首 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"扬旆邯郸道，蹁跹多柳条。\n何因不攀折，欲赠意先摇。\n义胜銮声远，神清马鬣骄。\n空情托流水，相送出河桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23072,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送皇甫水部赴荆州?竹木","author":"沈鍊","text":"使节遥临楚，湘云上马鞍。\n客行千里路，民爱一分宽。\n?处平看水，閒时静咏兰。\n惟应冰雪调，持此称冬官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23073,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王先生抱道林壑别号养浩一日出卷命余赋之","author":"沈鍊","text":"白首林中客，青山物外居。\n无忧仍进酒，多静只观书。\n枕石眠山气，餐霞饱太虚。\n浩然忘老去，宇宙复焉如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23074,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"沈鍊","text":"矫矫封侯客，能为笔砚羁。\n清狂非幼志，浩啸激幽思。\n下里听群和，高山叹独知。\n久惭韩邓笑，咄咄自惊疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23075,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽葛卮山大参","author":"沈鍊","text":"家世绾银黄，鸣镳出建章。\n官随勋并转，名以节先扬。\n宝剑人争识，遗弓子独藏。\n谁能书太史，彤管有辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23076,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中寄邹重文","author":"沈鍊","text":"寻真访道数经秋，今日方成万里游。\n玉洞秖疑天上坐，金河不是世中流。\n渊明嗜酒犹逢社，徵伯耽书懒下楼。\n剩欲过溪同一笑，移文恐作北山羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23077,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱进士北上应试","author":"沈鍊","text":"猎猎风吹吴市尘，行人更复送行人。\n洛阳三月君先到，正值桃花上苑春。\n酌酒劝歌多慷慨，登途跨马莫逡巡。\n今宵仗剑遨游客，已是当庭献纳臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23078,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"沈鍊","text":"沙塞黄花带雪开，谪臣中酒坐徘徊。\n睢阳骂贼心偏壮，上国思君意未灰。\n南北风尘常按剑，乾坤气序笑含杯。\n醉醒数把春秋看，还有程婴救赵来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23079,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日泛湖","author":"沈鍊","text":"春日湖容丽藻扬，楼船临泛在中央。\n泉怜词客留清响，山对佳人学靓妆。\n柳叶褰衣同作帐，桃花过酒并生香。\n共嗟此地无双景，莫厌堤边游冶郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23080,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄诸生杨子中","author":"沈鍊","text":"碧柳清霄怨暮春，沙明水白更伤神。\n娟娟野月当楼静，冉冉飞花入座频。\n海畔音书常阻绝，山城瘦马苦逡巡。\n坐怜物色多惆怅，欲觅芳洲綵句新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23081,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜月","author":"沈鍊","text":"月华宵霁彩云端，天上遥传白玉盘。\n解道清光千里在，不知今昔几人看。\n高楼自恨关山远，短笛仍悲道路难。\n碧水春风俱涕泪，举头何日见长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23082,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日试诸友偶成","author":"沈鍊","text":"精舍会临兰若地，春城初试管弦时。\n日移云影过书幌，风送花香入砚池。\n淑气韶光皆中节，幽花奇鸟总成词。\n承明正忆长杨赋，莫遣挥毫待日迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23083,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]